<p>It&#x27;s not recommended to use <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">role=&quot;meter&quot;</span></span></code></span> when the component should represent a scalar value as it&#x27;s screenreader support is poor.</p>
